  "sourceTitle": "New agent skill: Amazon SageMaker optimized generative AI inference for your coding agent",
  "sourceBodyHash": "c551bf31ee7c0e8c87e8e19f7cb103f8af84ac8bd2846e9f24fc5c587d5d711f",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-06T02:33:47.480600Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-06T03:37:22.317128Z",
  "totalBlocks": 73,
  "translatedBlocks": 57,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b680f57e04354a1",
      "translationZh": "工程师们越来越多地使用编程辅助工具来加速其开发工作流。如今，针对 Amazon SageMaker AI 优化的生成式 AI 推理引入了 aws-ai-ml 技能，该技能可通过 Agent Toolkit for AWS 获取。此技能为 Kiro、Claude Code 和 Codex 等编程智能体提供了在推理优化和基准测试方面的深厚专业知识。安装该技能后，您现有的智能体可以代表您对端点进行基准测试、推荐部署配置、比较性能运行情况，并生成可执行的 SageMaker Python SDK v3 代码。aws-ai-ml 技能是一个可以插入任何支持模型上下文协议 (MCP) 的编程智能体的工具包，从而将其转变为 SageMaker AI 推理优化专家。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97c7a8e8e7c18697",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，我们将详细介绍该技能的功能、如何进行设置，以及它如何帮助您更快地实现从模型到生产的过渡。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f715546f24482344",
      "translationZh": "挑战：弥合意图与基础设施之间的鸿沟",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cc722535156884a",
      "translationZh": "Amazon SageMaker AI 支持跨实时、批量和异步模式的服务端托管。它提供按需和预留容量、异构实例、虚拟私有云 (VPC) 隔离、自动缩放，并与每种 SageMaker AI 训练路径集成。其覆盖范围广泛且深入，但大多数工程师在开始时并不知道哪种实例系列或推理容器最能满足其需求。他们带着用例而来：一个想要达到的性能目标、一个需要保持在范围内的成本预算，或者一个在投入生产前需要评估的模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b74e3caed9d58dbc",
      "translationZh": "针对 SageMaker AI 优化的生成式 AI 推理的智能体体验弥补了这一差距。您告诉智能体您想要实现的目标，它会生成可执行的 SageMaker Python SDK v3 代码，您可以对其进行审查、修改并在自己的环境中运行。该智能体会提出有针对性的澄清问题，生成基于真实基准测试和实测性能数据的代码，并像解决方案架构师一样适应您的业务约束。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2af1a7648dbaf6df",
      "translationZh": "在整个过程中，您始终保持控制权。每一步都是实时的，并且以您可以阅读和质疑的代码形式呈现。不会有任何操作发生在不透明的 UI 之后。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f6ca7d9da2cc4ce",
      "translationZh": "您可以通过本地机器上的 Agent Toolkit for AWS 安装 aws-ai-ml 技能，或者在 Amazon SageMaker Studio JupyterLab 空间中使用它。无论哪种方式，您都可以在 10 分钟内从零开始建立起有效的对话。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "656530d9e7c2af8f",
      "translationZh": "选项 A：与任何编程智能体配合使用（Kiro、Claude Code、Codex 或任何兼容 MCP 的智能体）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac3ff8db16059f31",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：安装 AWS 代理工具包。如果您尚未设置，请配置代理工具包。这需要安装 AWS 命令行界面（AWS CLI）2.35 或更高版本以及 uv。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb617a1ce36446ee",
      "translationZh": "此功能会自动检测您的智能体，安装技能并配置 AWS MCP 服务器。有关特定智能体的设置（插件安装命令、MCP 配置），请参阅 AWS 智能体工具包入门指南。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27a3c068a592f2db",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：安装 aws-ai-ml 技能。将针对 SageMaker AI 优化的生成式 AI 推理技能添加到您的智能体中：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53751bb80402938f",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：确认并开始。打开您的编码智能体的聊天面板并询问：“有哪些可用技能？”您应该会看到 aws-ai-ml 列在其中。确认后，用自然语言描述您的意图。您的编码智能体现在已内置 SageMaker AI 推理优化专业知识。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ffde6610b4ffdc7b",
      "translationZh": "先决条件：您的 AWS 凭证必须具有调用 SageMaker AI API 的权限（创建端点、运行基准测试和推荐任务）。该技能生成的代码将在您的凭证下运行。该技能本身无需额外的 AWS 身份和访问管理 (IAM) 配置。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19672b9ebd0b795c",
      "translationZh": "注意：对于 Kiro 和 Claude Code，智能体可以在运行时发现技能。它们可以通过 AWS MCP Server 按需搜索并加载技能，而无需任何本地安装。您可以询问您的智能体：“搜索与数据库相关的 AWS 技能。”有关在运行时发现技能的信息，请参阅 readme。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a26cbe784972d105",
      "translationZh": "选项 B：在 Amazon SageMaker Studio 中使用",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2d995712002d418",
      "translationZh": "如果您更喜欢在托管的 JupyterLab 环境中工作，可以使用预配置镜像在 Amazon SageMaker Studio 中调用该技能。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f89f63095f68a32f",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：打开 Amazon SageMaker Studio。在您的目标 AWS 账户和 AWS 区域中导航至 Amazon SageMaker Studio。选择您的 Studio 域，并从您的用户配置文件启动 Studio IDE。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6335e4f371c1e3d",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：创建 JupyterLab 空间。从 Studio 登陆页面，选择 JupyterLab，然后选择创建 JupyterLab 空间。为空间命名（例如，my-inference-opt），并保持共享设置为 Private（仅在私有空间中同步技能）。在 Image 菜单下，选择包含 SageMaker AI 优化的生成式 AI 推理技能的镜像。该镜像预配置了 aws-ai-ml 代理技能及所有必要依赖项。选择运行空间并等待其启动（首次启动需 5–10 分钟）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "022736716b612d79",
      "translationZh": "注意：使用全新空间。重用带有本地修改的技能版本的空间可能无法获取预配置的镜像。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "141f6e3e548ff2a9",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：打开 JupyterLab 并启动终端。空间启动后，打开 JupyterLab 并选择 Terminal。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "632735ea66abadb5",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：授权你的编码代理。在终端中，使用你的身份提供者对你的编码代理进行身份验证。例如，使用 Kiro：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74563db9665a251b",
      "translationZh": "步骤 5：确认并开始。打开你的编码代理的聊天面板，询问：“有哪些技能可用？”你应该能看到已列出的 aws-ai-ml。确认后，用自然语言描述你的意图。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5171326a22810e62",
      "translationZh": "如果代理报告没有可用的技能，请验证你的空间是否设置为 Private。你也可以从终端进行检查：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c70f06f862ed1c4f",
      "translationZh": "如果该目录为空但 /etc/sagemaker/skills/ 包含技能文件，则运行 restart-jupyter-server，刷新页面，然后重试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "713fd0bacfcd01e0",
      "translationZh": "代理体验涵盖了推理优化生命周期中的以下功能。您无需知道要调用哪个功能。描述您想要的内容，您的代理将确定下一步骤，或在有不明确之处时提出澄清问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ff7b7f45695ef385",
      "translationZh": "基准测试现有端点",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cea842f4cb7c0c60",
      "translationZh": "如果您已经在 SageMaker AI 端点上部署了模型，可以让代理为其进行基准测试。告诉代理您想要测试的端点，它将生成一个使用 SageMaker Python SDK 中的 Workload.synthetic() 和 start_benchmark() API 运行负载测试的 Python 笔记本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5fc752ce1b9cd4a2",
      "translationZh": "在运行任何基准测试之前，代理会确认您的端点可以安全地进行负载测试，因为基准测试会向活动端点发送真实流量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ec005cb40074047",
      "translationZh": "基准测试完成后，您将获得包含以下内容的定量性能报告：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "91769b8cd0cbff29",
      "translationZh": "吞吐量：每秒请求数，每秒输出 token 数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "554037aa3c9c43d4",
      "translationZh": "延迟：p50，p99，首 token 延迟，间 token 延迟。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "40ef988e07957455",
      "translationZh": "并发数：支持的同时请求数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac2d46bcfab3a4bb",
      "translationZh": "这些是来自真实基础设施上真实负载的测量值，而不是估算值。代理还会推荐改进机制（如预填充解码）以提升性能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ec40318a35028a5",
      "translationZh": "Example prompt: “在 SageMaker AI 上基准测试我的 Llama 端点。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4b22331e578f68a8",
      "translationZh": "为您的模型寻找合适的实例类型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ebc7e4a265e772a",
      "translationZh": "如果您有一个模型，需要在 SageMaker AI 上找到合适的实例类型来部署它，请告诉您的代理。您的模型位于何处或您如何获得它都无关紧要：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44a6b1f8ede2a6cf",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) 中的微调或自定义模型：您已经训练或下载了一个模型并将其存储在 S3 中。提供 S3 URI 和您的优化目标。示例提示：“我想要在 SageMaker 上部署我的微调模型时找到最便宜的实例类型。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cc87c101e9c12c77",
      "translationZh": "来自 Amazon SageMaker JumpStart 的公开可用基础模型：您希望从 JumpStart 目录部署一个基础模型（FM），然后提供模型 ID。示例提示：“在 SageMaker AI 上为模型 huggingface-reasoning-qwen3-8b 寻找最佳实例。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8f98debdaeea7243",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Hub 上的模型：您想要使用托管在 Hugging Face 上的模型。提供模型名称。对于受限模型（如 Llama 变体），您的代理会显示许可条款并要求您接受它们并提供您的 Hugging Face 令牌。示例提示：“我想要从 Hugging Face Hub 部署一个 Llama 模型。最便宜的选项是什么？”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bcdf233722dc7d80",
      "translationZh": "在所有情况下，您的代理会生成代码，以评估您的模型相对于候选实例和配置，然后呈现带有具体性能指标的排名部署选项：吞吐量、延迟百分位数、首个标记时间和并发度。您根据成本和性能需求进行选择。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "418ed7b3150e512f",
      "translationZh": "比较基准运行",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d642981bb5c74c9",
      "translationZh": "如果您运行了多个基准测试（例如，在配置更改前后，或跨两种实例类型），您可以让代理进行比较。提供两个基准测试作业名称，代理将生成一个比较，计算关键指标的增量：吞吐量、延迟百分位数和首词元延迟。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6c36d416b23f171",
      "translationZh": "结果显示百分比变化，正值表示更好，从而提供一个单一且易于解释的摘要，说明您的更改是提升了性能、降低了性能，还是没有显著影响。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8fd7b8ef3a40b4c",
      "translationZh": "如果某个基准测试运行不存在，代理会先提供运行它，然后再进行比较。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0528289c7e787df",
      "translationZh": "示例提示：“我有两个基准测试运行，我想比较它们。哪一个更快？”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bbb4ef5d1baba51",
      "translationZh": "此表格在相同的基准工作负载（512/256 标记，并发 4）下比较两个已部署的模型。Δ% 列显示模型 B（Qwen3-8B）相对于模型 A（Qwen3-1.7B）在每个指标上的提升幅度。正值表示模型 B 更好。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f544c934a8818628",
      "translationZh": "这两个模型在不同的硬件上运行。Qwen3-8B 使用 4-GPU ml.g5.12xlarge（4x A10G），而 Qwen3-1.7B 使用单个 L4 GPU（ml.g6.4xlarge）。这些增量反映了大约 4 倍的计算能力，而不仅仅是模型本身。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ad6300c67daf040",
      "translationZh": "要点：Qwen3-8B 提供大约 44–47% 更高的吞吐量和更低的端到端延迟，这主要归功于额外的 GPU 计算。Qwen3-1.7B 仅在首词元延迟上占优，这是在单个 GPU 上运行较小模型的预期优势。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9ef87cdb1345972c",
      "translationZh": "综合起来",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "243908cf4da53327",
      "translationZh": "您不需要记住功能名称或知道要请求哪个工作流。以下表格展示了常见请求如何映射到结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a15638294dad77cc",
      "translationZh": "“我已经部署了一个模型，想知道它的速度有多快。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "592d8833f7048082",
      "translationZh": "定量性能报告：吞吐量、延迟百分位数、来自实际负载的并发指标。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0de82c806fa9f624",
      "translationZh": "“我在 S3 中有一个模型，不知道应该部署在哪种实例上。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f9afcd875dd3b90",
      "translationZh": "带有每个候选配置的成本、吞吐量和延迟的排名部署选项。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "385d5cedd15e6b27",
      "translationZh": "“我想部署一个 JumpStart 模型并找到最便宜的实例。我只有模型 ID。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8842be8abfd10be",
      "translationZh": "排名部署选项，无需 S3 暂存。如有需要，会显示受限模型的替代方案。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0abfab28823dc69",
      "translationZh": "“我在更改前后都运行了基准测试。哪一个更快？”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
